-- Equilibration of a seven-component gas condensate from a COMPVD table that
-- names both phases, over a water zone. The vapour rows describe the gas cap
-- above the gas-oil contact at 2574 m and the liquid rows the zone below it,
-- each with its own composition and its own hydrostatic column. The datum at
-- 2574.5 m lies in the hydrocarbon, above the water-oil contact at 2624 m, so
-- the water column is carried down from that contact. There are no wells; the
-- few short time steps only verify that the initial state is stable.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
